{# Synthetic affidavit of service. Imitates the NYC Civil Court layout. No real case. #}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
  @page { size: Letter; margin: 0.9in 0.85in; }
  body { font-family: "Times New Roman", Times, serif; font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 1.45;
         color: #111; }
  .court { text-align: center; font-size: 11pt; letter-spacing: .02em; }
  .court strong { display: block; font-size: 12pt; }
  hr { border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #111; margin: 10px 0; }
  table.caption { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 6px; }
  table.caption td { vertical-align: top; padding: 2px 0; }
  td.parties { width: 62%; }
  td.index { width: 38%; padding-left: 14px; border-left: 1px solid #111; }
  .vs { padding-left: 46px; font-style: italic; }
  h1 { font-size: 12.5pt; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;
       letter-spacing: .06em; margin: 22px 0 4px; }
  .sworn { font-size: 10.5pt; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  p.body { margin: 0 0 10px; text-align: justify; }
  .label { font-variant: small-caps; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  table.desc { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 6px 0 12px;
               font-size: 10.5pt; }
  table.desc th, table.desc td { border: 1px solid #111; padding: 3px 6px; text-align: left; }
  table.desc th { background: #eee; font-weight: normal; font-variant: small-caps; }
  table.attempts { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 4px 0 12px; font-size: 10.5pt; }
  table.attempts th, table.attempts td { border: 1px solid #111; padding: 3px 6px;
                                         text-align: left; }
  table.attempts th { background: #eee; font-weight: normal; font-variant: small-caps; }
  .sig { margin-top: 26px; }
  .sigline { border-bottom: 1px solid #111; width: 58%; height: 26px; }
  .cap { font-size: 9.5pt; }
  .notary { margin-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #111; padding-top: 10px; font-size: 10.5pt; }
  .fineprint { font-size: 9pt; color: #444; margin-top: 16px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="court">
  <strong>CIVIL COURT OF THE CITY OF NEW YORK</strong>
  COUNTY OF {{ county }}
</div>
<hr>

<table class="caption">
  <tr>
    <td class="parties">
      {{ aff.plaintiff }},<br>
      <span style="padding-left:46px">Plaintiff,</span><br>
      <span class="vs">- against -</span><br>
      {{ aff.defendant_name }},<br>
      <span style="padding-left:46px">Defendant.</span>
    </td>
    <td class="index">
      <span class="label">Index No.</span> {{ aff.index_number }}<br><br>
      <span class="label">Affidavit of Service</span>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
<hr>

<h1>Affidavit of Service</h1>
<div class="sworn">STATE OF NEW YORK, COUNTY OF {{ county }}, ss.:</div>

<p class="body">
  {{ aff.server_name }}, being duly sworn, deposes and says: that deponent is not a party to
  this action, is over 18 years of age, and resides in the State of New York. Deponent is a
  process server duly licensed by the New York City Department of Consumer and Worker
  Protection, License No. {{ aff.server_license }}, employed by {{ agency }},
  Agency License No. {{ aff.agency_license }}.
</p>

<p class="body">
  That on <strong>{{ aff.served_at.strftime('%B %-d, %Y') }}</strong> at
  <strong>{{ aff.served_at.strftime('%-I:%M %p') }}</strong>, at
  <strong>{{ aff.served_address }}</strong>, deponent served the within Summons and
  Endorsed Complaint upon {{ aff.defendant_name }}, the Defendant therein named, in the
  following manner:
</p>

{% if aff.method.value == '308_1' %}
<p class="body">
  <span class="label">Personal Service (CPLR &sect; 308(1)).</span>
  By delivering a true copy of each to said Defendant personally. Deponent knew the person
  so served to be the person described as said Defendant therein.
</p>
{% elif aff.method.value == '308_2' %}
<p class="body">
  <span class="label">Substituted Service (CPLR &sect; 308(2)).</span>
  By delivering a true copy of each to
  {{ aff.recipient_name or 'a person of suitable age and discretion' }}{% if aff.recipient_relationship %},
  {{ aff.recipient_relationship }}{% endif %}, a person of suitable age and discretion. Said
  premises is the Defendant's dwelling place within the State of New York. The person served
  refused to state whether the Defendant was in the military service of the United States.
</p>
{% else %}
<p class="body">
  <span class="label">Affix and Mail (CPLR &sect; 308(4)).</span>
  By affixing a true copy of each to the door of said premises, the same being the
  Defendant's dwelling place within the State of New York. Deponent was unable with due
  diligence to find the Defendant or a person of suitable age and discretion thereat, having
  previously attempted service as set forth below.
</p>
{% endif %}

{% if aff.recipient_description and aff.recipient_description.raw_text %}
<p class="body"><span class="label">Description of person served:</span></p>
<table class="desc">
  <tr>
    <th>Sex</th><th>Skin</th><th>Hair</th><th>Age</th><th>Height</th><th>Weight</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    {% for cell in description_lines %}
    <td>{{ cell.split(': ')[1] if ': ' in cell else cell }}</td>
    {% endfor %}
  </tr>
</table>
{% endif %}

{% if aff.attempts %}
<p class="body"><span class="label">Prior attempts at service:</span></p>
<table class="attempts">
  <tr><th>Date</th><th>Time</th><th>Address</th><th>Result</th></tr>
  {% for attempt in aff.attempts %}
  <tr>
    <td>{{ attempt.at.strftime('%m/%d/%Y') }}</td>
    <td>{{ attempt.at.strftime('%-I:%M %p') }}</td>
    <td>{{ attempt.address }}</td>
    <td>No answer at door</td>
  </tr>
  {% endfor %}
</table>
{% endif %}

{% if aff.mailing_date %}
<p class="body">
  <span class="label">Mailing.</span>
  That on {{ aff.mailing_date.strftime('%B %-d, %Y') }}, deponent enclosed a true copy of
  each in a postpaid, properly addressed envelope marked &ldquo;Personal and
  Confidential&rdquo; and bearing no indication that the communication was from an attorney
  or concerned an action against the Defendant, and deposited said envelope in an official
  depository of the United States Postal Service within the State of New York, addressed to
  the Defendant at {{ aff.mailing_address }}.
</p>
{% endif %}

<div class="sig">
  <div class="sigline"></div>
  <div class="cap">{{ aff.server_name }} &mdash; Process Server License No. {{ aff.server_license }}</div>
</div>

<div class="notary">
  Sworn to before me on this ______ day of ____________, 20____.
  <div class="sig">
    <div class="sigline"></div>
    <div class="cap">
      {{ notary_name }}, Notary Public, State of New York<br>
      Qualified in {{ notary_county }} County &mdash; Commission expires
      {{ commission_expiry.strftime('%B %-d, %Y') }}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% if aff.proof_filed_date %}
<p class="fineprint">
  Proof of service filed with the Clerk of the Court on
  {{ aff.proof_filed_date.strftime('%B %-d, %Y') }}.
</p>
{% endif %}
<p class="fineprint">
  SYNTHETIC DOCUMENT &mdash; generated for ServeTrace testing. Not a real affidavit. All
  parties, servers, licence numbers and index numbers are fictitious.
</p>

</body>
</html>
